{"datasets":{"sheet1":{"columns":[{"id":"c1","title":"A","type":"text"},{"id":"c2","title":"B","type":"text"},{"id":"c3","title":"C","type":"text"},{"id":"c4","title":"D","type":"text"},{"id":"c5","title":"E","type":"text"}],"datasetID":"eafe8cf9-97f7-4359-bcb1-991346afd295","title":"loan-0.xlsx \u00b7 Loan","writable":true}},"excelBehavior":{"actions":[],"gaps":[],"outputs":["sheet1!D2"],"source":"function recreate(input){const c=input.cells;const pv=Number(c['sheet1!B2']);const rate=Number(c['sheet1!C2']);const nper=Number(c['sheet1!E2']);let payment;if(!Number.isFinite(pv)||!Number.isFinite(rate)||!Number.isFinite(nper)){return {'sheet1!D2':'#VALUE!'}}if(nper===0)return {'sheet1!D2':'#DIV/0!'};if(rate===0){payment=pv/nper;}else{payment=(rate*pv)/(1-Math.pow(1+rate,-nper));}return {'sheet1!D2':String(Math.round(payment*100)/100)};}"},"name":"Loan Calculator","sdkVersion":1,"source":"const {h,mount,Column,Text,TextField,Button,Table,signal,data}=Sevra;\nconst selected=signal(null),selection=signal(''),input=signal(''),search=signal(''),busy=signal(false),status=signal('');\nfunction clear(){selected.value=null;selection.value='';input.value='';}\nfunction select(e){if(busy.value)return;const r=e.value;if(!r||r.values.c1==='Loan'){clear();return;}selected.value=r;selection.value=r.key;input.value=r.values.c2||'';status.value='';}\nasync function save(){if(busy.value||!selected.value)return;const row=selected.value,value=input.value.trim();if(!value){status.value='Enter a principal';return;}busy.value=true;try{await data.transaction([{op:'update',table:'sheet1',id:row.id,values:{c2:value}}]);clear();status.value='Saved';}catch(e){status.value=e.message;}finally{busy.value=false;}}\nconst root=h(Column,{gap:16},h(Text,{text:'Loan Calculator',size:24,weight:'bold'}),h(TextField,{label:'Search',value:search}),h(Table,{table:'sheet1',label:'Records',search,selection,onSelect:select,height:300,enabled:()=>!busy.value}),h(Text,{text:'Principal'}),h(TextField,{label:'Principal',value:input,enabled:()=>!busy.value&&!!selected.value}),h(Button,{title:'Save changes',onClick:save,enabled:()=>!busy.value&&!!selected.value}),h(Text,{text:status}));\nmount(root);"}
